    "summary": "The user, a retired academic, expresses deep existential despair and feelings of redundancy due to the rise of AI in their field of study. The assistant responds with empathetic, philosophical validation, framing the user's past work as a foundation for the future while acknowledging the user's feeling of being unnecessary to the world's efficiency.",
